This repository is the public support site for Volume+, a commercial Stream Deck
plugin sold on the Elgato Marketplace. It exists for bug reports, feature
requests, and headset-compatibility work.

The Volume+ plugin itself is a closed-source commercial product and is NOT
included in this repository.

The documentation, issue templates, images, and other written content in this
repository are published so users can read and reference them. They may be
quoted for the purpose of discussing or reporting issues with Volume+. They may
not be redistributed as a whole or used to promote a different product without
written permission.

